      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Influence of differentiated use of the alimentary factors on the lipemia level, hemocoagulation activity, arterial pressure level, carbohydrate tolerance and catecholamine content in the blood plasma of CHD patients was shown under the conditions of controlled dietotherapy. Incorporation of diet in multimodality therapy and prevention of this disease under inpatient, sanatorium-prophylactic and outpatient conditions was emphasized."},
